    },
    {
      "start": 53.24,
      "end": 54.58,
      "text": "那我一圈看下来"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.58,
      "end": 55.68,
      "text": "锁定了Flash系列"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.68,
      "end": 56.96,
      "text": "因为它们够快够省"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.96,
      "end": 58.12,
